      "writtenOn": "2021-10-13T12:54:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming that there\u0027s a reasonable memory type that covers the different backends, I think it could be useful for clients of Buffer to know about the memory type.\n\nThe really high level clients are already going to go through a writer-like interface, and that could hide the memory type. But a buffer pool or sub-allocator could find it useful IMO",
      "parentUuid": "2b9aaa94_2cccd829",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 37,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "42ac84617be1f5bb35949cf607a66601b0d70c6c",
